                        "entry_id": "e407e4ac-fc07-359f-89a5-79e0121401b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A member of the Society of Mary, a congregation of Roman Catholic brothers and priests who look to the Virgin Mary as a model of faith and spirituality."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33216656-debd-4c4d-9b1f-44ed5810ec85",
                                "sense_id": "1973013a-4e57-31e5-8ed5-4403b6ba8ba5",
                                "text": "And Catholic Marianists, for their part, have looked for ultimate authority instead in the miraculous realm of mystical visions and end-time prophecy. Mainly because of their passionate commitment to anti-abortion activism, Catholic conservatives have thus far wielded a far greater public presence than either separatists or Marianists."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
